{"id":"1fd6e0844d0c8dd1","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-nonprincipal-type.md","title":"Nonprincipal Type","display":"df-nonprincipal-type — Nonprincipal Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-nonprincipal-type","aliases":["93-df-nonprincipal-type"],"display":"df-nonprincipal-type — Nonprincipal Type","depends_on":["[[93-df-type]]","[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-nonprincipal-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-nonprincipal-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonprincipal-type — Nonprincipal Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03527aba4c537723\" href=\"?note=03527aba4c537723\" title=\"93-df-type\">93-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b587d680bb02f51\" href=\"?note=8b587d680bb02f51\" title=\"93-df-semantic-consequence\">93-df-semantic-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\\)</span> is the semantic partial-type predicate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is first-order consequence.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is the mnemonic free-variable sort tag.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\psi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(\\{\\psi\\},\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\psi\\}\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\psi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(\\{\\psi\\},\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\psi\\}\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A principal type must have one jointly realizable isolating formula that semantically implies every member over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"03527aba4c537723","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-semantic-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"8b587d680bb02f51","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-semantic-consequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonprincipal\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NonPrin}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\land\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\psi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(\\{\\psi\\},\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\{\\psi\\}\\models_{\\operatorname{FOStr}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1439,"backlinks":[{"id":"840f3a795c44b39b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["03527aba4c537723","8b587d680bb02f51"]}